ernance/create-action-on-approval.md","line":167},{"title":"Create an action for an 'on Catalog item launch' policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-action-on-cat-item-launch.md","line":169},{"title":"Create an action for an 'on Catalog item request start/end' policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-action-on-cat-item-request.md","line":171},{"title":"Create an action for an 'on Lease end' policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-action-on-lease-end.md","line":173},{"title":"Create an action for an 'on Resource operation' policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-action-on-resource-op.md","line":175},{"title":"Create an action for an 'on Resource operation launch' policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-action-on-resrce-op-launch.md","line":177},{"title":"Cloud User Portal","target":"cloudmgt-cloud-user-portal","line":178},{"title":"Create an action for an 'on Resource operation request start/end' policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-action-on-resrce-op-reqst.md","line":179},{"title":"Create an action for an 'on Resource Limit exceeded' policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-action-on-resource-limits-exceeded.md","line":181},{"title":"Create an action for an 'on Task Remediation' policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-action-on-remediation.md","line":183},{"title":"Create a policy action script","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-policy-script.md","line":185},{"title":"Example policy action script that tags resources","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/add-tag-for-policy.md","line":187},{"title":"Policies for Cloud Provisioning","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/cloud-policy.md","line":190},{"title":"Remediation","target":"ccg-remediation","line":194},{"title":"Cloud Admin Portal","target":"cloud-admin-portal","line":195},{"title":"Cloud Provisioning and Governance","target":"cloud-management-v2-landing-page","line":196},{"title":"Cloud User Portal","target":"cloudmgt-cloud-user-portal","line":197}],"metadata":{"title":"Create a cloud policy","description":"A cloud policy can override a property value set by a user, create an approval task, reserve an IP address, pre-populate or hide form fields, execute custom scripts, call the Cloud API, or start or abort subflows. A cloud policy gives you system-wide control over approvals, resource operations, blueprint operations, or catalog item settings.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/it-operations-management/cloud-configuration-governance/create-cloud-policy.html","release":"australia","product":"Cloud Configuration Governance","classification":"cloud-configuration-governance","topic_type":"task","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":8,"breadcrumb":["Policies f